<h1>Youth Club Management Software</h1>

<p class="lead">Youth club management software for rosters, schedules, dues, and communication in one place — built so parent volunteers can spend time with kids, not spreadsheets.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-calendar.png" alt="Youth club calendar with practices, meetings, and RSVPs" width="827" height="827" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="why-youth" class="card" aria-labelledby="why-youth-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="why-youth-heading">Why youth groups pick GatherPack</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Youth activities live or die on coordination — who’s coming, who paid, who can drive, who’s allergic to peanuts. GatherPack gives every youth and family one shared record (contact info, relationships, dietary needs, shirt sizes) and teams that scope events and messages so families only see what’s theirs. The same tool that ran a decade of robotics team growth now fits scouts, 4-H, coding clubs, and after-school programs.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">MIT-licensed and open source: self-host free or get <a href="/hosting/">managed hosting</a> (Standard $50/mo, Custom $100/mo + plugins). <a href="/open-source/">Compare options</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

