<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Youth club FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can parents update their kids’ info?</h3>
    <p>Yes — families manage relationships and custom fields themselves, so leaders aren’t the bottleneck. Team scoping keeps data private to the right adults.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can we handle dues online?</h3>
    <p>Yes — Stripe for cards and bank transfer today; Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>. See <a href="/features/finance/">finance</a> for the ledger + receipts flow.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">What about privacy for minors?</h3>
    <p>Access is team-scoped — a family team sees its kids, a leader sees their group. Sensitive fields stay with authorized managers. More at <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

